{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52167","headline":"道林养性歌二首（题拟） 一 · 孙思邈","name":"道林养性歌二首（题拟） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美食须熟嚼，生食不麤吞。\n问我居止处，大宅揔林村。\n胎息守五藏，气至骨成仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙思邈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}